{"6a5b63ad817a2f2976669d8f":{"Channels":{},"Title":"1.5问题反馈方式","pakInfos":{},"Content":[{"language":"CN","backgroundImage":"http:\/\/pan01-cdn-dna-ali.shyxhy.com\/upload\/END-CNS.png","announcementContentConfiguration":[{"titleOne":"问题反馈方式","combo":[{"body":"<div data-page-id=\"UUN2daEO5oSBG4x3LCCcdIa8nLN\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnEtEGqsdUSwbfOBOjBOe0Rb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"UUN2daEO5oSBG4x3LCCcdIa8nLN\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnEtEGqsdUSwbfOBOjBOe0Rb\">亲爱的狩月人：<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnmNQAfKnAtaO5X92Hfefsob\">「先遣服测试服」现已开启，狩月人在测试过程中遇到任何问题或建议想法，都可以通过以下方式进行反馈。<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnAGj0nOyQ43Ljj5zbebbs8x\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnlj7gYSNStyzYd4Iputzsob\"><strong>★建议与BUG反馈方式★<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn6esffINYhmcrSZFDVEEgkc\">✦ 问卷填写<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnaAID9j8aZfGEW9e60XEomf\">1、进入反馈问卷地址【<a href=\"https:\/\/herogames.feishu.cn\/share\/base\/form\/shrcnALXmYAZg79j13oAaDcyJmf\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">游戏建议<\/a>】【<a href=\"https:\/\/herogames.feishu.cn\/share\/base\/form\/shrcnALXmYAZg79j13oAaDcyJmf\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">BUG反馈<\/a>】<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn5yWuneFjeHARmrxZxEzwQc\">2、填写反馈内容（如截图无法直接看出问题，希望可以附上复现的录屏）<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnDTB0o59YKhKzzTLjBZvVTf\">3、填写设备信息与联系方式<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FyWDdoe2RoR3j1xnuISceakrnch\">4、若因文件体积过大无法上传，可添加 QQ：2488629902 反馈问题，添加时请备注来意<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnrsO7Cnbl2MzEPduywtCOOb\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnjdzvEE7PdKi3z6oMSnBLah\">欢迎各位狩月人踊跃提供意见和建议，帮助我们持续优化游戏体验，共同建设一个更好的《二重螺旋》。<\/di